event: thinking
data: {"id": "8be18487cf4f4486-thinking-parallel_evidence-1237", "run_id": "8be18487cf4f4486", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "采集完毕。\n\n### 1. 已采集事实\n- **Pod 状态**：`aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 当前处于 **Pending** 阶段。\n- **调度状态**：`PodScheduled` 条件为 `False`，原因 `Unschedulable`。\n- **根本原因**：Pod YAML 中包含 `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`。集群中所有 3 个节点均未匹配该选择器（3 nodes didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector）。\n- **事件记录**：多次 `FailedScheduling` 事件，均指向节点选择器不匹配。\n- **拓扑关系**：Pod 由 ReplicaSet `workload-68c557d875` 创建，进而属于 Deployment `workload`。\n- **日志维度**：因 `monitor` 命名空间权限不足无法直接查询 Elasticsearch 日志，但 Pod 处于 Pendin", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788404484199, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "8be18487cf4f4486-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "8be18487cf4f4486", "seq": 1238, "ts_ms": 1788404492747, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 51.065, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-01", "name": "workload-68c557d875-llhkh"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/8be18487cf4f4486-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "8b0e48f796ac50d00bb684ca5ac116d0aa2b2cebef18e5760128d1cb88233384", "bytes": 2451}, "snapshot_sha256": "d52c8c18d5e61b4277b87eb701f40124887525c8b29badd0c1e0ecea75cae366"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "8be18487cf4f4486-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "8be18487cf4f4486", "seq": 1239, "ts_ms": 1788404492747, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "8be18487cf4f4486-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "8be18487cf4f4486", "seq": 1240, "ts_ms": 1788404499923, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.175, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1337, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod workload-68c557d875-llhkh (aiops-case-01) 持续处于 Pending 状态，未被调度到任何节点。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status: Pending`, `pod.condition: Unschedulable` | 确证 Pod 未调度且处于不可调度状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available` | 明确指示所有节点均未通过亲和性/选择器检查 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.cpu: 5m`, `memory: 8Mi`; `limit.cpu: 50m`, `memory: 32Mi` | 排除因资源不足导致调度的可能性 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}: 1` | 辅助确认当前处于 Pending 状态 |\n\n**证据关联：**\nK8s 事件（#2）明确指出“3 个节点都不匹配 Pod 的节点亲和性/选择器”，结合状态（#1）证实了调度失败。资源请求（#3）极低，排除了资源耗尽这一常见原因，将故障范围精准锁定在亲和性配置上。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义包含 nodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable=true → 集群内 3 个节点均未设置该 label，无法匹配 → 调度器标记为 Unschedulable 并记录 FailedScheduling 事件 → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态且 nodeName 为空\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 配置了不存在的节点选择器**。\n\nPod 定义了 `nodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable: 'true'`（证据 #2），而集群内所有 3 个节点均未拥有该 Label。这导致 `default-scheduler` 在调度时判定所有节点均不满足亲和性要求，进而触发 `FailedScheduling` 事件并导致 Pod 永远处于 Pending 状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod workload-68c557d875-llhkh (aiops-case-01) 持续处于 Pending 状态，未被调度到任何节点。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status: Pending`, `pod.condition: Unschedulable` | 确证 Pod 未调度且处于不可调度状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available` | 明确指示所有节点均未通过亲和性/选择器检查 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `container.resource_request.cpu: 5m`, `memory: 8Mi`; `limit.cpu: 50m`, `memory: 32Mi` | 排除因资源不足导致调度的可能性 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}: 1` | 辅助确认当前处于 Pending 状态 |\n\n**证据关联：**\nK8s 事件（#2）明确指出“3 个节点都不匹配 Pod 的节点亲和性/选择器”，结合状态（#1）证实了调度失败。资源请求（#3）极低，排除了资源耗尽这一常见原因，将故障范围精准锁定在亲和性配置上。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义包含 nodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable=true → 集群内 3 个节点均未设置该 label，无法匹配 → 调度器标记为 Unschedulable 并记录 FailedScheduling 事件 → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态且 nodeName 为空\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 配置了不存在的节点选择器**。\n\nPod 定义了 `nodeSelector: aiops.lab/unavailable: 'true'`（证据 #2），而集群内所有 3 个节点均未拥有该 Label。这导致 `default-scheduler` 在调度时判定所有节点均不满足亲和性要求，进而触发 `FailedScheduling` 事件并导致 Pod 永远处于 Pending 状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

